{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36420","headline":"宿武安山有怀 · 罗邺","name":"宿武安山有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野店暮来山畔逢，寒芜漠漠露华浓。\n窗间灯在犬惊吠，溪上月沈人罢舂。\n远别只愁添雪鬓，此生何计隐云峯。\n离心却羡南飞翼，独过吴江更数重。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36420.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36420","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}